  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "12982436",
      "title": "[OPTIONAL] Assignment Solution",
      "lectureOrder": 356,
      "videoOrder": 331,
      "sourceHash": "9591982b792e6936ee8c4ea1eb9971fc809a9c09669513589239372b82d23e42",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.701,
          "end": 6.155,
          "en": "-: So where you successful? Here's my solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.155,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "We should add an input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "So I'll add a horizontal line again just to have some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "separation, and then my input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "The label of course, is optional.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "I want a user to enter username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.41,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "So let's add a input which receives this class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.34,
          "end": 22.98,
          "en": "which is for control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.98,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "If we save this and have a look at our application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 26.73,
          "en": "this is how it looks like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.73,
          "end": 29.82,
          "en": "Now, if you don't want to have it sit directly on the edges",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.82,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "you can of course add some bootstrap styling to this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 35.43,
          "en": "So maybe a container with a row inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "and then you call XS 12 class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 40.65,
          "en": "So feel free to wrap your content in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "It's not required for the solution of this, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "So with that, we got our input field here with the username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "Now let's bind this username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "to a property of our TypeScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "So here I will add a new property to my app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "and I will name this property \"username.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "This will be a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 64.5,
          "en": "and I will set it to an empty string initially like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 65.333,
          "en": "Now we learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.333,
          "end": 68.088,
          "en": "that we can use two-way binding to bind to this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.088,
          "end": 72.57,
          "en": "So on my input here, I'll add two-way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.57,
          "end": 75.96000000000001,
          "en": "by adding square bracket, and then parentheses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.96000000000001,
          "end": 80.96000000000001,
          "en": "This is this two-way binding syntax, and then NG model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 85.97,
          "en": "Now with that added, I can bind to my username like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 90.75,
          "en": "Now, important: for NG model to work, you need to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.75,
          "end": 94.74000000000001,
          "en": "that in your app module you have FormsModule added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.74000000000001,
          "end": 96.03,
          "en": "to the imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.03,
          "end": 100.41,
          "en": "because the NG model directive technically is part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "of the FormsModule provided by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 105.33,
          "en": "So make sure that you have this. You should have it there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.33,
          "end": 108.18,
          "en": "by default when using a CLI project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.18,
          "end": 110.13,
          "en": "And then with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.13,
          "end": 112.923,
          "en": "we should update the username on every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 115.35,
          "en": "Now to be able to see that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.35,
          "end": 117.50999999999999,
          "en": "I'll add a paragraph below the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.50999999999999,
          "end": 121.078,
          "en": "And here I want to output \"username.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.078,
          "end": 124.638,
          "en": "Now with that being output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.638,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "we can save this. NG Serve should be running, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 134.12,
          "en": "And we should see that if I enter \"supermax\" here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 136.41,
          "en": "we see it below the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.41,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "So the first two tasks here are solved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 142.746,
          "en": "Now let's add the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.746,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "So we'll add a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 148.799,
          "en": "below paragraph where I will say reset user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.799,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "And this button will first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 152.61,
          "en": "of all receive some bootstrap classes, button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.61,
          "end": 154.77,
          "en": "button primary to make it look nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "But more importantly, we should disable it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 160.74,
          "en": "if the username is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.74,
          "end": 162.999,
          "en": "Now, how can we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.999,
          "end": 167.49,
          "en": "We have learned that we can bind to be disabled property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.49,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "Now, even though we used that a couple of times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 171.6,
          "en": "that's of course not the only property you can bind to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.6,
          "end": 174,
          "en": "but it's the one we will need here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174,
          "end": 177.84,
          "en": "Now, disabled, we could set disabled to some property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.84,
          "end": 179.31,
          "en": "which is true or false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.31,
          "end": 182.37,
          "en": "or we directly set it to true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 185.22,
          "en": "But as I explained, between the quotation marks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.22,
          "end": 187.74,
          "en": "you simply have a expression which resolves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 187.74,
          "end": 190.02,
          "en": "to a true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.02,
          "end": 195.02,
          "en": "Now, since we want to disable this, if the username is empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.33,
          "end": 199.17000000000002,
          "en": "we could simply check that between quotation marks here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.17000000000002,
          "end": 202.82999999999998,
          "en": "So we could say, disable this if username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.82999999999998,
          "end": 207.57,
          "en": "this property, is equal to an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.57,
          "end": 210.87,
          "en": "So two single quotation marks inside here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.87,
          "end": 212.023,
          "en": "With this expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212.023,
          "end": 215.57999999999998,
          "en": "this will return true if username is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 215.57999999999998,
          "end": 218.22,
          "en": "Therefore then this button will be disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "otherwise it will be false and the button will be enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 223.98,
          "en": "Let's see if this works as expected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.98,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "After saving this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "the button is indeed disabled at the beginning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 231.438,
          "en": "because username clearly is an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.438,
          "end": 234.3,
          "en": "But as soon as I type anything in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.3,
          "end": 237.45,
          "en": "you see it gets enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.45,
          "end": 239.67000000000002,
          "en": "So this is how we can use property binding again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.67000000000002,
          "end": 242.37,
          "en": "with any expression which returns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.37,
          "end": 245.64,
          "en": "as the value the property we're binding to expects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.64,
          "end": 248.223,
          "en": "So in the case of disabled, true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.21,
          "end": 251.91,
          "en": "Now with that, we get this solved, too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.91,
          "end": 253.77,
          "en": "Now we should also add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.77,
          "end": 256.77,
          "en": "to this button so that we can reset the username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 256.77,
          "end": 258.78,
          "en": "once we do click the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.78,
          "end": 262.98,
          "en": "So event finding with normal parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.98,
          "end": 265.26,
          "en": "let's find to click for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.26,
          "end": 268.83,
          "en": "And here we could call on reset a method where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 268.83,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "we then set the username equal to an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 274.53,
          "en": "But since this is all we're going to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 274.53,
          "end": 278.76,
          "en": "I can also just say username equals empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.76,
          "end": 280.499,
          "en": "And now don't mistake this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 280.499,
          "end": 283.83,
          "en": "for the syntax we used here on the disabled property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 283.83,
          "end": 287.79,
          "en": "there we have three equal signs to check something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 287.79,
          "end": 291.779,
          "en": "Here we have one equal sign to assign a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.779,
          "end": 293.52,
          "en": "With this in place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.52,
          "end": 296.49,
          "en": "we should now be able to go back to the application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 296.49,
          "end": 300.21,
          "en": "enter supermax here, and if I click \"Reset User,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 300.21,
          "end": 302.43,
          "en": "it's empty and the button is disabled again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 302.43,
          "end": 304.98,
          "en": "because we reset the username string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.98,
          "end": 308.25,
          "en": "And that is our assignment on data binding solved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.25,
          "end": 309.633,
          "en": "I hope you enjoyed it.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
